<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mills Corp started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mills Corp started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Mills Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- expects Mills to earn $1.87 a share in 1997 and $2.09 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Mills was up one to 24-3/4 at midday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
